  "title": "One-Skillet Roasted BBQ Chicken and Vegetables",
  "description": "This one-skillet dish from Julie Wampler of Table For Two includes your meat and veggies and is made directly on the grill for a quick and easy dinner any night of the week!",
  "authors": [
